    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Part travel journal, part visual novel with a hint of psychological horror, Melbourne: Route 96 is an experimental game about catching a tram in the wrong direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>&quot;If you\u2019re honest with your camera, then a polaroid will never lie. ..&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loosely inspired by true\u00a0events, the game includes snippets of real\u00a0conversations overheard whilst exploring Melbourne, Australia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short duration (15 - 20 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand drawn graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multi media experience with original photography &amp;\u00a0videography</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel journal</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Part travel journal, part visual novel with a hint of psychological horror, Melbourne: Route 96 is an experimental game about catching a tram in the wrong direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>&quot;If you\u2019re honest with your camera, then a polaroid will never lie. ..&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loosely inspired by true\u00a0events, the game includes snippets of real\u00a0conversations overheard whilst exploring Melbourne, Australia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short duration (15 - 20 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand drawn graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multi media experience with original photography &amp;\u00a0videography</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel journal</p></li></ul>",
